---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---
<MainLayout title="Our Vision">
  <section class="bg-hero px-6 py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1400px] gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] lg:items-center">
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm">Our Purpose</span>
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-6xl">Building Thinkers,<br />Not Just Students.</h1>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
          At NPconscious, we believe learning should feel natural, curiosity-driven, and accessible to everyone.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
          <a href="https://wa.me/918088276492" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-amber-400 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:-translate-y-0.5">Book Demo</a>
          <a href="mailto:npconscious@gmail.com" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-slate-50">Contact Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-4 shadow-soft">
        <img src="/vision.png" alt="Learner-focused vision illustration" class="img-card" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-24 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl space-y-10 text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-slate-500">Our Vision</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Learning Has No Age Limit</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-8 shadow-soft transition hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 text-xl font-semibold text-white">01</div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Curiosity First</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">We encourage students to question concepts, think independently, and genuinely enjoy learning.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-8 shadow-soft transition hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 text-xl font-semibold text-white">02</div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Learning For Everyone</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">From 5 to 105, anyone can understand mathematics with the right guidance and mindset.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-8 shadow-soft transition hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 text-xl font-semibold text-white">03</div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Real Understanding</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">We focus on clarity, logic, and strong fundamentals instead of memorization alone.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-24 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-10 shadow-soft">
      <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
        At NPconscious, we believe education should nurture curiosity, confidence, and the ability to think independently.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
        Our mission is not just to improve marks — but to help students naturally enjoy learning and understand the world around them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-24 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-[2rem] bg-slate-950 p-16 text-center text-white shadow-soft sm:p-12">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold">Connect With NPconscious</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">Start your learning journey with curiosity-driven education.</p>
      <a href="mailto:npconscious@gmail.com" class="mt-10 inline-flex rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-slate-100">Send Email</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
